  <h1>Enshrouded 1.0 Release: Date, Platforms, Level Cap and Everything New</h1>

  <p class="muted">
    Enshrouded leaves Early Access with <strong>1.0 on October 15, 2026</strong>, launching on
    <strong>PC (Steam), PlayStation 5</strong> (including PS5 Pro) and <strong>NVIDIA GeForce
    Now</strong>. The full release raises the player level cap to <strong>50</strong> and gear to
    <strong>55</strong>, opens the <strong>Cinder's Cradle</strong> biome and closes the current story
    arc, adds <strong>9 new spells</strong>, the <strong>Sparkworks</strong> logic system, and it
    <strong>resets every skill tree</strong>. Existing Early Access saves and bases keep working.
  </p>

